  "description": "Independent offline verifier for Pruvz Evidence Packet export bundles, the per-action evidence of AI agent outcome verification (what the agent claimed vs. what the system of record showed): JSON Schema and consistency validation, canonical commitments, signed seals under a pinned trust registry, Merkle log inclusion/consistency, and RFC 3161 anchor verification. Self-sufficient offline; verifies against a caller-pinned trust root only.",
